# Irithel, Jungle Heart

> Irithel is a walking DPS turret with no brakes. She shoots while she moves, her ultimate cleaves grouped backlines, and her two-item spike ends games against tanks, but her base HP and physical defense run low while her attack growth runs high. Peel her properly and she wins the match; let an assassin touch her and she dies in under a second.

