## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Gold Lane Sprint Crit (Gold)

- Items: Swift Boots, Haas's Claws, Berserker's Fury, Windtalker, Malefic Gun, Blade of Despair
- Core: Haas's Claws, Berserker's Fury, Windtalker
- Emblem: Marksman Emblem with Fatal, Weapon Master, Quantum Charge
- Battle spell: Sprint
- Flex: Wind of Nature over Blade of Despair when Use when the main threat is physical burst that reaches you during Heavy Crossbow.; Rose Gold Meteor over Blade of Despair when Use against magic burst or mixed dive that kills you before Sprint creates distance.; Sea Halberd over Malefic Gun when Use when a healer, shield support, or high-extra-HP front liner keeps the first target alive.; Malefic Roar over Malefic Gun when Use when enemies are stacking Physical Defense and range is less important than armor scaling.
- Total cost: 12130 gold

Default gold lane build that rushes crit uptime, then uses Sprint and Malefic Gun range to keep Irithel firing while moving.

### Anti-Dive Flicker (Gold)

- Items: Warrior Boots, Haas's Claws, Berserker's Fury, Windtalker, Wind of Nature, Malefic Gun
- Core: Haas's Claws, Berserker's Fury, Windtalker
- Emblem: Marksman Emblem with Fatal, Weapon Master, Quantum Charge
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Tough Boots over Warrior Boots when Use when the lane threat or jungle threat is magic damage or chain crowd control.; Rose Gold Meteor over Wind of Nature when Use when the burst profile is mixed or magic-heavy instead of physical.; Blade of Despair over Wind of Nature when Use only when your roam and EXP laner can reliably keep divers away from you.
- Total cost: 11040 gold

Safety build for physical dive games where Flicker and Wind of Nature matter more than a greedier sixth damage slot.

### Heavy CC Cleanse (Gold)

