- Core: Haas's Claws, Berserker's Fury, Windtalker
- Emblem: Marksman Emblem with Fatal, Weapon Master, Quantum Charge
- Battle spell: Purify
- Flex: Wind of Nature over Rose Gold Meteor when Use when the crowd control is manageable but physical burst is the actual kill threat.; Blade of Despair over Rose Gold Meteor when Use after your team proves it can cleanse or block the first engage for you.; Sea Halberd over Malefic Gun when Use when anti-heal or anti-shield is required before range can decide the fight.
- Total cost: 10930 gold

Cleanse setup for stun-heavy drafts where Purify and Rose Gold Meteor buy the first second Irithel needs to keep moving.

